@startuml
[*] --> CreateAccount : start registration
CreateAccount --> LoggedIn : registration successful
CreateAccount --> [*] : registration failed

LoggedIn --> CheckWeather : check weather
CheckWeather --> InvalidLocation : invalid location entered
InvalidLocation --> [*]

CheckWeather --> ChooseCheckType : valid location
ChooseCheckType --> ShowWeatherInfo : selected check type

ShowWeatherInfo --> AdditionalDetails : view more details
AdditionalDetails --> [*] : logout

ShowWeatherInfo --> LoggedOut : log out
@enduml
